  "description": "A small, generic 2D geometry library for .NET: a numeric Vector2D<T> and primitives (circle, rectangle, triangle, line, point) with fluent Overlaps/Contains/Intersects queries, generic over any INumber<T>. A hobby library, great for games, prototypes and learning.",
